# Normalize line endings so editors that write CRLF don't produce
# whole-file phantom diffs. Files are stored LF in the repository
# regardless of what the working tree contains.
#
# Without this, an editor rewriting a file with CRLF shows up as every
# line changed (e.g. `git diff` reporting 354+/354- on a file with no
# content change), which buries real edits and makes review noisy.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.gz binary
*.tgz binary
*.zip binary
*.wasm binary
